UPDATE companies SET description='RANDYS Worldwide is headquartered in Everett, Washington, and has operated since 1982.

RANDYS designs, engineers, and manufactures a range of drivetrain, suspension, towing, and wheel products under a family of brands that includes Dynatrac, Yukon Gear & Axle, USA Standard Gear, ICON Vehicle Dynamics, Carli Suspension, Cognito Motorsports, and BulletProof Hitches. The company operates two high-tech testing labs at its Everett facility to validate products against strict specifications, and holds 13 design patents. A network of 13 distribution centers enables same-day shipping that reaches 95 percent of U.S. customers within one to two days. RANDYS also provides remanufacturing services, technical support, installation manuals, and gear-ratio calculators.

Customers range from weekend off-road enthusiasts to professional installers and large retail accounts. Its product lines cover differentials and traction devices, suspension and steering systems, driveshafts, towing hitches, wheels, and off-road armor.

RANDYS emphasizes its combination of in-house engineering, rigorous testing, and deep technical knowledge as its primary differentiators. The company states that its engineering team continuously refines designs, its testing labs ensure only approved products reach the market, and its sales and technical staff provide installation guidance tailored to each vehicle’s specifications and usage.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Remanufacturing", "Product design and engineering", "Testing and validation", "Warehousing and distribution", "Technical support", "Same-day shipping", "Installation guidance", "Gear ratio calculation", "Differential and traction component manufacturing", "Suspension and steering component manufacturing", "Driveshaft manufacturing", "Towing hitch manufacturing", "Wheel manufacturing", "Off-road armor manufacturing"], "industries": ["Automotive aftermarket", "Off-road performance", "OE replacement", "Drivetrain", "Suspension", "Towing", "Wheels"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "1-2 days for 95% of US customers via same-day shipping", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Two high-tech testing labs at the Everett, WA facility validate every product to strict specifications", "Engineering team holds 13 design patents for drivetrain and suspension components", "Same-day shipping from 13 distribution centers delivers to 95% of U.S. customers in 1\u20132 days", "Family of brands covers both performance and OE replacement markets", "Technical sales and support staff provide installation guidance for each application"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1982 -> /about-us", "Headquartered in Everett, Washington -> /about-us", "13 distribution centers across North America -> /about-us", "Two high-tech testing labs in Everett facility -> /about-us", "13 design patents held -> /about-us", "Same-day shipping reaches 95% of US customers in 1-2 days -> /about-us", "Manufactures brands including Dynatrac, Yukon Gear