UPDATE companies SET description='RC Metal Works Inc, doing business as RC Metalworks, operates from Johnston, Rhode Island. The company has delivered sheet metal fabrication and ductwork services since 1987, focusing on commercial and industrial HVAC systems.

The shop fabricates ductwork and custom metal components from galvanized steel, aluminum, stainless steel, black iron, copper, and lead-coated copper. Its capabilities include SMACNA-standard ductwork, custom sheet metal orders, ductwork installation, and repair services for all metal types. The team handles projects ranging from standard air ducts to custom panels, drain pans, machine guards, cupola covers, and steel frames, working from customer sketches or specifications.

Clients span hospitals, universities, laboratories, government facilities, commercial and residential developments, and heavy industry across Rhode Island, Massachusetts, and Connecticut. The company coordinates installation and repairs around operating hours to minimize disruption for facilities such as hospitals and universities.

RC Metalworks emphasizes craftsmanship, precision, and deep HVAC expertise. All ductwork is fabricated to SMACNA standards with a full review of fabrication quality, sealing, fit, and structural integrity before completion. Post-installation airflow testing and adjustment ensure long-term performance.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Sheet metal fabrication", "SMACNA-standard ductwork fabrication", "Custom sheet metal fabrication", "Ductwork installation", "Ductwork repair", "Custom metal component fabrication (panels, drain pans, machine guards, cupola covers, steel frames)"], "industries": ["Hospitals", "Universities", "Laboratories", "Government facilities", "Commercial developments", "Residential developments", "Heavy industry"], "materials": ["Galvanized steel", "Aluminum", "Stainless steel", "Black iron", "Copper", "Lead-coated copper"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Fabrication to SMACNA standards", "Custom-built components from customer sketches", "Off-hours and phased scheduling for minimal disruption", "Full quality review and airflow testing on every project"], "facts_used": ["Location: Johnston, Rhode Island -> db", "Founded: 1987 (Since 1987) -> /", "Materials: galvanized steel, aluminum, stainless steel, black iron, copper, lead-coated copper -> /", "Industries served: hospitals, universities, laboratories, governments, commercial developments, residential developments, heavy industry -> /", "Capabilities: SMACNA-standard ductwork, custom sheet metal, ductwork installation, ductwork repairs -> /", "Service area: Rhode Island, Massachusetts, Connecticut -> /", "Differentiators: SMACNA standards, custom from sketches, off-hours work, quality review and airflow testing -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "At RC Metalworks, we are specialists in sheet metal fabrication and ductwork for commercial and industrial HVAC systems.", "found