UPDATE companies SET description='Radius Packaging, headquartered in Milwaukee, Wisconsin, was founded in 1972. Since its inception, the company has supplied plastic packaging solutions for diverse consumer and industrial markets, building decades-long relationships with brands.

The company operates two facilities, including a 250,000-square-foot plant in Delavan, Wisconsin, that houses both blow molding and injection molding platforms. Radius produces rigid plastic containers from HDPE, PP, and PET, offering capabilities that span custom product development, cellular blow molding for short- to medium-run orders, turn-key injection molding for caps and closures, and value-added services such as high-speed automated labeling, custom packaging, and warehousing programs.

Radius serves the food and specialty beverage, nutrition and wellness, home care, healthcare, and professional cleaning industries. Its customer base includes brands seeking off-the-shelf stock packaging, tailored designs, or fully customized solutions developed from concept through commercialization.

The company emphasizes a holistic approach that integrates manufacturing platforms with design, engineering, and sustainability services. Radius highlights its OSHA SHARP-certified Delavan facility, partnership with the U.S. Army PaYS program, and collaboration with material suppliers like LyondellBasell as differentiators, alongside a track record of industry awards for processing excellence and workplace culture.', certifications=ARRAY['OSHA SHARP Certified']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Blow molding (HDPE, PP, PET)", "Injection molding (caps, closures, tubs)", "Custom product development (discovery, design, development, delivery)", "High-speed automated pressure-sensitive labeling", "Custom packaging (re-shippers, bulk boxes, returnable dunnage)", "Warehousing and stocking programs", "Sustainability consulting (post-consumer resin, barrier resin, single-stream recycling)", "Cellular manufacturing", "Turn-key integrated solutions"], "industries": ["Food & Specialty Beverage", "Nutrition & Wellness", "Home Care", "Healthcare", "Professional Cleaning"], "materials": ["High-density polyethylene (HDPE)", "Polypropylene (PP)", "Polyethylene terephthalate (PET)"], "equipment": ["High-speed automatic pressure-sensitive labeling equipment"], "volume": "Short- to medium-run, with flexibility for high-volume production", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Integrated blow molding and injection molding in a 250,000 sq. ft. facility", "Short- to medium-run flexibility with capacity for high-volume production", "High-speed automated pressure-sensitive labeling in a single pass", "Custom product development from concept to commercialization", "OSHA SHARP certified facility and U.S. Army PaYS partnership"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1972 -> db, /about-us", "Headquarters Milwaukee, Wisconsin -> db", "Two facilities including 250,000 sq. ft. Delavan facility -> /about-us", "Blow molding and injection molding capabilities -> /about-us, /capabilities", "Materials: HDPE, PP, PET -> /capabilities", "Markets: Food & Specialty Beverage, Nutrition & Wellness, Home Care, Healthcare, Professional Cleaning -> /", "Short- to medium-run packaging solutions with flexibility for larger runs -> /about-us", "Custom product development from concept to commercialization -> /capabilities", "High-speed automated pressure-sensitive labeling equipment -> /capabilities", "Custom packaging (re-shippers, bulk boxes, returnable dunnage) -> /capabilities", "Warehousing and stocking programs -> /capabilities", "OSHA SHARP Certified Delavan facility -> /", "U.S. Army PaYS Program partnership -> /", "LyondellBasell collaboration -> /", "Sustainability practices: post-consumer resin, barrier resin, single-stream recycling -> /capabilities", "Cellular manufacturing for blow molding -> /, /capabilities", "Turn-key injection molding with caps and closures -> /, /capabilities", "Awards: Plastics News Processor of the Year, Top Workplace -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Our two facilities feature a range of manufacturing platforms that give us the ability to select the right process for your production needs, whatever they are. We recently expanded our manufacturing footprint to include a state-of-the-art 250,000 sq. ft. facility in Delavan, WI which features blow molding and injection molding capabilities to create complete rigid plastic packaging solutions.", "founded_year": "1972", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='radius-packaging-west-allis' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Railside Furnishings operates from Mifflinburg, Pennsylvania, where it was founded in 2001 as a family-owned venture. The business began with a focus on handcrafted, solid-wood furniture built by Amish craftsmen, a tradition that continues to define its output.

The company produces custom furniture — dining sets, bedroom suites, living room pieces, office furniture, youth collections, and live-edge items — along with fully designed kitchen cabinetry. Each piece is handbuilt by an in-house team or by Amish woodworkers using 100% real wood. The shop also provides 3D renderings for kitchen projects and manages delivery and installation for completed orders.

Homeowners and families make up the core clientele, with projects ranging from single heirloom tables to whole-kitchen renovations.

