UPDATE companies SET description='Red River LLC operates from Gillette, Wyoming, where it was born in the American West out of a desire to bring back domestic manufacturing. The company evolved from a small local fabricator into an experienced pressure vessel and prefabrication partner, shipping products coast to coast for clients ranging from international public companies to startups. No founding year or individual founders are named in the company''s public materials.

The shop fabricates ASME-certified custom and OEM pressure vessels, prefabricated piping, spools, structural components, and modular skid packages. Core processes include design with specialized software, welding, assembly, coating, and final inspection by an ASME Authorized Inspector.

Customers are typically solution providers and innovators who involve Red River from concept through startup, often on proprietary or confidential projects.

