UPDATE companies SET description='Renesas Electronics America operates from Morrisville, North Carolina, as the U.S. subsidiary of Renesas Electronics Corporation, a global semiconductor company headquartered in Japan. The American arm supports the corporation''s mission to deliver embedded semiconductor solutions across automotive, industrial, infrastructure, and IoT markets.

The company provides a broad portfolio spanning analog and mixed-signal circuits, power management devices, embedded processing (MCUs and MPUs), and connectivity products. Its technology includes GaN power devices, GreenPAK programmable mixed-signal ICs, and high-performance computing solutions. Renesas employs over 21,000 professionals across more than 30 countries, with design, sales, and support operations worldwide.

Customers include automotive OEMs and tier-1 suppliers, industrial automation vendors, data-center and robotics developers, and IoT device makers. The firm''s solutions appear in applications such as electric-vehicle power trains, factory automation, AI data-center power delivery, and low-power edge-computing endpoints.

Renesas emphasizes its system-level expertise and the industry''s widest product portfolio as differentiators, aiming to reduce development effort through reusable design assets and pin-compatible device families. Its stated purpose, ''To Make Our Lives Easier,'' underscores a focus on power-efficient, sustainable semiconductor solutions.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Analog and mixed-signal design", "Power semiconductor design", "Embedded processing (MCU/MPU)", "GaN power device development", "GreenPAK programmable mixed-signal ICs", "Automotive-grade semiconductor solutions", "Industrial semiconductor solutions", "IoT connectivity solutions", "High-performance computing solutions"], "industries": ["Automotive", "Industrial", "Infrastructure", "IoT", "AI data centers", "Robotics", "Human-machine interface (HMI)"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Industry''s leading expert in embedded processing with unmatched system-level know-how", "Broadest product portfolio covering analog, power, embedded processing, and connectivity", "Scalable, comprehensive semiconductor solutions for automotive, industrial, infrastructure, and IoT", "Power-efficient, sustainable designs that reduce development effort through reusable assets", "Pin-compatible MCU/MPU families enabling seamless product scaling"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters in Morrisville, North Carolina -> db", "Subsidiary of Renesas Electronics Corporation (Japan) -> /about", "Over 21,000 professionals in 30+ countries -> /about", "Product portfolio: analog, power, embedded processing, connectivity -> /about", "Technologies: GaN, GreenPAK, high-performance computing -> /about and /", "Industries served: automotive, industrial, infrastructure, IoT -> /about", "Applications: EV power trains, factory automation, AI data centers, edge computing -> / and /about", "Purpose: ''To Make Our Lives Easier'' -> /about", "System-level expertise and broadest portfolio as differentiators -> /about", "Pin-compatible MCU/MPU families for reusable design assets -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Renesas is an embedded semiconductor solution provider driven by its Purpose ''To Make Our Lives Easier.'' As the industry''s leading expert in embedded processing with unmatched quality and system-level know-how, we have evolved to provide scalable and comprehensive semiconductor solutions for automotive, industrial, infrastructure, and IoT industries based on the broadest product portfolio, including High Performance Computing, Embedded Processing, Analog & Connectivity, and Power.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "21,000+", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='renesas-electronics-america' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
